WHAT THIS IS NOT
One run each, one machine, one day. Not a ranking, and not a score on Artificial Analysis' Decision Index. On BANKING77 the first start of both runs stopped on connection timeouts to OpenRouter before any benchmark question was sent; both were run again from the beginning, and the stopped starts are kept, not counted. In the reruns some calls timed out, came back with an upstream error (HTTP 504 or HTTP 503) or came back empty. NeuroLink made {{d1-ultra.banking77.retries|int}} extra attempts on one d1-ultra call and {{d1.banking77.retries|int}} on four d1 calls; the empty d1 reply was not retried, so the kit asked that question again. All of it is on the tape.

